@kaucjarz_api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5223

### Getting all users
GET {{kaucjarz_api_HostAddress}}/User/GetUsers/
Accept: application/json

### Adding new user
POST {{kaucjarz_api_HostAddress}}/User/PostUser
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email":"testowymail@gm.co",
    "name":"tester2",
    "password":"test123",
    "role":0
}

### Veryfying login logic
Post {{kaucjarz_api_HostAddress}}/User/VerifyLogin
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "login":"testowymail@gm.co",
  "password":"test123"
}

### Getting all orders
GET {{kaucjarz_api_HostAddress}}/Order/GetOrders/
Accept: application/json

### Adding new order
POST {{kaucjarz_api_HostAddress}}/Order/AddOrder
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "userId": 1,
    "city": "New York",
    "street_address": "Downtown 13",
    "flat_nr": "4A",
    "estimated_bottles": 30,
    "status": 0,
    "pickup_date": "2026-11-27",
    "pickup_time_slot": "14:00-16:00",
    "details": "testing details"
}